WEBVTT

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.590
The upcoming National Foundation Day is an
important event, and it should be celebrated,

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:18.720
but what the hell is being
done about those giants?!

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:21.890
We governors are not even
getting any information...

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.060
What are the government and army doing?

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:26.730
What is going on, Prime Minister?

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:32.730
The army has been on alert since the
second attack, and is ready for anything.

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:36.360
Then we should begin operations immediately!

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:41.070
At present, we simply cannot predict where
or when the giants will appear again...

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:48.040
The army has already begun preparations.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:52.750
The thing we must prioritize is
ensuring the safety of citizens.

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:33.560
Hey, Ingrid...

00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:35.400
Which do you like?

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:49.790
Abel!

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.750
This place isn't very welcoming.

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:55.800
There's nothing we can do about that.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:01.300
My Princess...

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:03.970
Man, I'm bored!

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:07.890
Hey, let's get moving, all right?

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.810
I get bored just sitting around here waiting.

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:14.480
All right, I'll go myself.

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:20.450
Abel?

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:24.740
Okay, but with humans,
there's a chance you won't "come back."

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:30.160
I am aware of that.

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:41.260
Suit yourself.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:48.060
I just ran out of puppets to take along, anyhow.

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:49.680
It's fine with me.

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:53.980
I'll leave it to you.

00:03:57.690 --> 00:03:59.530
Thank you.

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.820
Good luck, Abel!

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:12.620
Please begin.

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:13.920
Okay-

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.500
This is...

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:20.210
We've identified her as the first
princess of Rimgarde, Ingrid Tiesto.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:24.380
Her voice print and facial recognition are
completely identical to the time of the incident.

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:27.640
It's true, she's just as she was 12 years ago.

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:33.230
If she's got some secret to
her youth, I'd love to hear it...

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:37.310
Please continue.

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:41.940
This is the Princess's personal military aide,

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:44.490
Commander Abel Lundestad.

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:46.950
This guy looks old.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:51.660
At the Fall of Rimgarde, all Rimgardians,
including the Princess, disappeared.

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:57.290
When it happened, the Commander was visiting us
to observe our military exercises, and so was spared.

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:01.460
Nobody has seen him since.

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:03.760
Why are they after Rena?

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:05.260
We are looking into that.

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:10.010
I wonder if they are
connected to the Regalia, too.

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:12.060
The girl is Kei.

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:14.230
She's a Regalia, like me.

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:21.400
I think she might be bound
to the one called Ingrid.

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:24.940
Rena...

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.120
Yes.

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:32.580
Huh?

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:34.540
It's Commander Lundestad!

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:42.790
He is currently being observed by
our forces at Milanike Bridge... and...

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:48.340
They say the Commander is asking to see Yui.

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:52.560
So, he is calling for me.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:56.810
I will go.

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:04.860
I have to go.

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:32.720
Is this really okay?

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:36.270
Commander Lundestad was
dispatched to Enastoria as part

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:40.730
of the officer exchange program
soon after his appointment.

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:44.690
He's not the type of man
to do something cowardly.

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:50.320
I am Yuinshiel Asteria.

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:53.700
I am Abel Lundestad, Your Highness.

00:06:57.160 --> 00:07:01.080
I thank you for fulfilling my selfish request.

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:04.880
I once had the pleasure of
being a resident of Enastoria.

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:13.010
It's beautiful now, just as it was back then.

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:15.050
Thank you.

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:17.850
I have not come to fight today.

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:20.230
I came to ask a favor of Your Highness.

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:21.560
A favor?

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:25.770
I request that you hand Rena over to me.

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:31.400
Why? Do you need Rena that badly?

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:36.110
I'm terribly sorry, but I can't answer that.

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:39.500
You won't even tell us why! There's no way I'd--

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:43.000
I cannot hand Rena over to you.

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:46.630
Yui...

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:51.340
I must protect everyone.

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:56.090
However, Your Highness, if you continue to fight us,
the people will surely suffer at some point.

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:00.390
You mean...

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:11.060
I can't imagine how heavily the responsibility
of protecting your country must weigh upon you.

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:18.530
Even if that is so... I must see it through!

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:22.120
I admire your resolve. However...

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:28.330
I wonder if a person can
bear that pressure all alone.

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:35.840
I am honored to have met
with you today, Your Highness.

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:38.470
We shall meet again on the battlefield.

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:45.270
Wait!

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:50.610
How can you say those things?!
You have no idea how she feels!

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:57.240
Yui doesn't need resolve! I am with her,
and I won't allow anyone to harass her!

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:03.790
You won't allow anyone to harass her, huh?

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.540
You understand nothing.

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:08.330
What about you?

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:10.920
Fine then, I'll show you
whether or not I understand!

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:12.130
Rena!

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:21.350
Don't do it, Rena! If we fight here--

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:23.810
Be quiet, Yui!

00:09:24.020 --> 00:10:27.910
Rena!

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:31.130
It's okay. You don't need to do anything.

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:34.710
I will defeat anyone that harasses you.

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:59.740
I'm back-- Whoa!

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:01.450
Hey, get back to work!

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:04.240
--Sorry, Retsu!
--We'll be right back!

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:44.280
Rena!

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:48.290
Is this the power you wanted to show me?

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:54.830
What do you seek with this power?

00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:58.630
Rena!

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:01.470
Rena! Rena, are you okay?

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:26.200
If you want to mess with Yui and Rena...
you'll have to get through us first!

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:28.660
No!

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:30.490
Stop, you two!

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:32.330
Yui! Why?

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:41.800
Do you wish to continue this boorish fight?

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:49.600
Rena, please...

00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:52.230
If you continue, the city will...

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:02.940
I'm afraid this intrusion has dampened
the mood. I'll be going now.

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:05.780
Intrusion? Does he mean us?

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:11.820
If this is the extent of your resolve, you will
be no match for Ingrid, Your Highness.

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:29.180
I see. So that is what happened.

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:33.180
Whatever the case,
I'm just glad that you're safe.

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:37.890
I... couldn't do anything.

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:42.690
I'm the Empress. I'm supposed
to protect everyone, and yet...

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:45.280
I couldn't...

00:13:47.030 --> 00:13:49.530
Is that the only excuse you have?

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:51.030
Your excellency! Yui was--

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:55.250
I do not expect to be protected by Yui herself.

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:03.090
Yuinshiel...

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:06.130
What does it mean to be Empress?

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:08.930
Please think about this once more.

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:42.590
Rena!

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:45.960
Are you looking for Yui?

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:48.880
No!

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:51.300
Stay away from her!

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:05.230
What is happening to me?

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:17.790
Why did you come back without
giving them a proper fight?

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:20.910
I never intended to fight them in such a place.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:21.790
Oh?

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:26.000
Plus, I've no interest in besting
an opponent in that state.

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:30.630
It's better to keep things interesting, right?

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:34.800
Wait a little longer,
and I'll give you what you want.

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:38.770
Sounds good. I look forward to it.

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:43.440
There's a memorial parade
in Almorica at 10 tomorrow,

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:45.860
followed by a celebratory event at 1,

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:48.820
and then at 4 at Nornil Square...

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:50.030
Yui, are you listening?

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:52.700
Oh... yeah.

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:57.450
Okay! We're going out, Yui!

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:58.370
Where?

00:15:58.580 --> 00:15:59.790
To let off some steam!

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:02.920
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:09.630
What's wrong? You look a little down.

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:11.840
Not hanging out with Yui today?

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:17.010
Take your time, okay?

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:34.240
Will the bridge get fixed?

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:37.410
Sorry we broke it.

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:40.160
It's not your fault.

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:43.370
I'm the one to blame.

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:47.380
You didn't come to chew us out?

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:50.710
Not at all.

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:54.800
--Okay, then!

00:16:58.430 --> 00:17:00.430
What's wrong, Rena?

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:06.470
I said I would protect Yui,
but I couldn't at all.

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:10.610
I wasn't strong enough.

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:14.240
Why don't you let Yui help you?

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:17.410
I always get help from Sara!

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:19.120
--Right?

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:22.330
You should act like us, Rena!

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:25.540
But...

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:29.250
It's just...

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:31.380
--What?

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:32.460
I'm going home.

00:17:32.670 --> 00:17:33.670
Huh?

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:34.970
What about your cake?

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:35.880
You can have it.

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:38.510
--Yay!

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:40.140
Renny?

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:43.850
We haven't been here for a while, huh?

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:48.400
Yeah, when we were little,
you brought me here all the time.

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:51.270
Whenever you had that look on your face...

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:03.780
I was determined to protect Rena,
to protect our country...

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.710
But I couldn't, not at all.

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:10.710
Let me show you something nice.

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:12.000
Huh?

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:29.650
Take a look.

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:53.590
Hmm? Hey!

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:56.250
Your Highness!

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:08.640
Hey, heeey!

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:16.940
That's great.

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:20.360
I was worried. She looked a little down!

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:23.240
All right, let's hang in there, guys!

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:29.030
I love Enastoria and everyone in it!

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:32.750
Empress Yui came to see us,

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:36.040
so we've got to work hard and
finish repairs by the end of the day!

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:37.840
That's right!

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:42.090
I'll put in a call to HQ and get a mobility
support bridge and some AVLBs sent in!

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:44.590
Hey, I was just kidding!

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:47.010
We can do it tomorrow!

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:52.770
Whatever happens, they stay
positive and keep smiling.

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:55.310
They're really amazing.

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:58.940
You're right. I love them too.

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:02.820
And yet, I couldn't do anything.

00:20:03.030 --> 00:20:05.530
But it's because of you, you know?

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:06.740
Huh?

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:13.040
It's because of you that we can keep
striving on, with smiles on our faces.

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:30.600
Rena!

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:36.310
Yui...

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:40.730
I'm sorry!

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:41.940
Huh?

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:47.870
I was so worried about doing everything right!

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:52.040
And that's why you had
to go through that, for me!

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:54.460
I'm the one who should be sorry!

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:56.580
I didn't think about your feelings.

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:58.340
You're always working so hard,

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:02.260
and then I go and tell you not to do anything...

00:21:02.470 --> 00:21:03.470
Rena...

00:21:06.050 --> 00:21:10.310
Let's go see Abel again.

00:21:10.510 --> 00:21:15.010
This time, we'll do it right, together.

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:18.650
But the two of us alone won't be enough.

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:20.480
Huh?

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:24.150
Will you continue to help us, please?

00:21:29.620 --> 00:21:33.620
Of course! Yui, Rena...

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:35.040
Thank you!

00:21:47.680 --> 00:21:52.180
All right, this might be a little sudden,
but will you do something for me?

00:21:59.900 --> 00:22:04.400
There's something I want to
tell the people of Enastoria.
